  description: 'Optimize your ice management routes to reduce drive time, improve response speed, and handle more accounts per crew with smarter scheduling and planning tools.',
  date: '2025-10-28',
  readTime: 5,
  intro: 'Efficient route planning is one of the highest-leverage activities an ice management company can invest in before winter arrives. A poorly sequenced route means crews spend more time driving between accounts than actually servicing them, burning fuel and missing response time windows. Rethinking how your routes are structured can dramatically increase the number of properties each crew handles per storm event.',
