  description: 'Learn how ice management software helps contractors track salt inventory in real time, prevent mid-season shortages, and reduce material waste across their operation.',
  date: '2025-11-18',
  readTime: 6,
  intro: 'Running out of salt during an active storm is one of the most damaging operational failures an ice management company can experience, leading to missed service events, angry clients, and potential liability exposure. Inventory tracking used to mean clipboards and manual counts, but modern ice management software makes it possible to monitor salt levels in real time across multiple storage locations. Getting your inventory management right is as important as having the right equipment on the road.',
